{"id":8840562096,"name":"Airship Assault","desc":"Airship Assault is a team-deathmatch game focused on aerial combat. Whether you choose to rule the sky with your trusty plane or defend your airship, you play a pivotal part in your team's success.\n\nCreated by Amir & Heedicalking\nInspired by myrkrwarrior's classic \"Zeppelin Battle\" from 2008 and \"Zeppelin Wars\" by IoIkiller101.\n\nPlayable on PC, Mobile, and Console.","path":"/game/8840562096-airship-assault","slug":"8840562096-airship-assault","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/cf1caba81637d872d9d5cfae5f1c4a293fd0de74b2b425fba34af3ed5c46fa99.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ce6eccca2bbc76adfbba71a9c5be8439/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":356,"visitor":68438396,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-04-14T06:46:45.878Z","creator":{"name":"Project Combat","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"69dde2d5081bc695de9fb194","title":"Humanoid HUB aimbot esp","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c78912","gameId":8840562096,"name":"Airship Assault","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/cf1caba81637d872d9d5cfae5f1c4a293fd0de74b2b425fba34af3ed5c46fa99.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ce6eccca2bbc76adfbba71a9c5be8439/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"slug":"8840562096-airship-assault","path":"/game/8840562096-airship-assault","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/cf1caba81637d872d9d5cfae5f1c4a293fd0de74b2b425fba34af3ed5c46fa99.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ce6eccca2bbc76adfbba71a9c5be8439/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"placeId":8840562096},"slug":"Airship-Assault-Humanoid-HUB-aimbot-esp-201234","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":3627,"executes":666,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a948ba53a088c547a39d0045b55a941666648158a2e50c4820c0da652a009a7a.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/8840562096-1776149205841.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/8840562096-1776149205841.png"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a948ba53a088c547a39d0045b55a941666648158a2e50c4820c0da652a009a7a.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/8840562096-1776149205841.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/8840562096-1776149205841.png"},"likeCount":2,"dislikeCount":1,"createdAt":"2026-04-14T06:46:45.881Z","updatedAt":"2026-04-14T06:46:45.881Z","lastBump":"2026-04-14T06:46:45.881Z","script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://pastebin.com/raw/RzSExWid\"))()","features":"Description:\nYo. I finally got rid of the FPS drops from the old GUI versions and fixed that annoying distance limit BS. V2 is a pure RAW script now. It runs completely in the background and is smooth as butter.\n\nI completely broke the ESP distance limits using math.huge. As long as the game engine hasn't completely despawned the player, you will see them across the entire map. Plus, it's a Universal engine, so it works on almost any standard Roblox game.\n\n🔥 V2 Features & Changelog:\n\nInfinite Range ESP: Box, Name, Distance, and Health Bar. The distance limit is completely trashed.\n\nPrediction Aimbot (RMB): Tired of shooting behind running targets? The engine now calculates player velocity (0.045 prediction) and aims slightly ahead of them. Guaranteed headshots.\n\nSticky Aim Fix: Fixed that seizure-inducing glitch where the aimbot snaps to another target walking by. Once it locks, it stays locked until you let go of Right Click.\n\nMax FPS Optimization: Removed heavy while wait() UI loops. Uses pure Drawing API. Zero lag, even on potato PCs.\n\nHow to use:\nJust execute the script, grab the key from the sleek UI, paste it, and hit Verify. The menu will close with a clean animation and the engine will start running instantly.\n\nGo dominate your lobbies. Drop a like if it works for you, and let me know in the comments if any specific game breaks it. Enjoy! 🚀","tags":["esp","radar","aimbot","fov"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/5kVYqnPw","keyLink":"https://linkvertise.com/3601903/RAYjp5C0VXV7?o=sharing","owner":{"_id":"69996e323c999592ac9eb137","username":"HumanoidPremium","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4adc16ca600a48f0d69d8b1317a81c8029f9c27533f411cbbbec1da34bc57901.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/69996e323c999592ac9eb137-1776404299001.png"},"status":"offline","id":"69996e323c999592ac9eb137","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":25},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4adc16ca600a48f0d69d8b1317a81c8029f9c27533f411cbbbec1da34bc57901.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/69996e323c999592ac9eb137-1776404299001.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-19T21:59:39.435Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"69dde2d5081bc695de9fb197","editBy":{"_id":"69996e323c999592ac9eb137","username":"HumanoidPremium","status":"offline","id":"69996e323c999592ac9eb137"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-04-14T06:46:45.885Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"69dde5f333a3811b5973e7f9","commentBy":{"_id":"69dd68a432a34ed4704c8d33","username":"OrbitPremiumScripts","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"lastActive":"2026-10-19T19:04:57.259Z","createdAt":"2026-04-13T22:05:24.039Z","lvl":6,"status":"offline","id":"69dd68a432a34ed4704c8d33","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"text":"Nice script","edited":false,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-04-14T07:00:03.061Z","liked":false,"disliked":false}]},{"_id":"688a699bcc6aebb2f49f9838","title":"Silent aim","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c78912","gameId":8840562096,"name":"Airship Assault","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/cf1caba81637d872d9d5cfae5f1c4a293fd0de74b2b425fba34af3ed5c46fa99.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ce6eccca2bbc76adfbba71a9c5be8439/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"slug":"8840562096-airship-assault","path":"/game/8840562096-airship-assault","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/cf1caba81637d872d9d5cfae5f1c4a293fd0de74b2b425fba34af3ed5c46fa99.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ce6eccca2bbc76adfbba71a9c5be8439/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"placeId":8840562096},"slug":"Airship-Assault-Silent-aim-46912","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":8524,"executes":559,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":true,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/dd48dbddf35d1f2744c3fb3589c4d450ac2aed2f50973acd8c5f4912139a63da.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-2d66a10e26888359f0a663fae705823b-a950e986ac8b.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/rbx-2d66a10e26888359f0a663fae705823b-a950e986ac8b.png"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/dd48dbddf35d1f2744c3fb3589c4d450ac2aed2f50973acd8c5f4912139a63da.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-2d66a10e26888359f0a663fae705823b-a950e986ac8b.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/rbx-2d66a10e26888359f0a663fae705823b-a950e986ac8b.png"},"likeCount":4,"dislikeCount":3,"createdAt":"2025-07-30T18:51:07.191Z","updatedAt":"2025-07-30T18:51:07.191Z","lastBump":"2025-07-30T18:51:07.191Z","script":"local players=game:GetService(\"Players\");\nlocal l=players.LocalPlayer;\nlocal camera=workspace.CurrentCamera;\nlocal m=require(game.ReplicatedStorage.Modules.Projectile);\nlocal UIS=game:GetService(\"UserInputService\");\n\n--// configuration \nlocal FOVR=120;local FOVON,SNAPON=true,true;\n\nlocal fov=Drawing and Drawing.new(\"Circle\") or nil;\nif fov then\n    fov.Visible=FOVON;fov.Thickness=2;fov.Radius=FOVR;fov.Color=Color3.new(1,1,1);fov.Transparency=0.5;fov.Filled=false;fov.NumSides=128;\nend\nlocal snap=Drawing and Drawing.new(\"Line\") or nil;\nif snap then\n    snap.Visible=SNAPON;snap.Thickness=1.5;snap.Color=Color3.new(1,1,1);snap.Transparency=0.8;\nend\n\n--code\nlocal function t()\n    local a;local ml=UIS:GetMouseLocation();local min=FOVR;\n    for _,b in next,players:GetPlayers() do\n        if b~=l and (not b.Team or not l.Team or b.Team~=l.Team) then\n            local ch=b.Character;local hd=ch and ch:FindFirstChild(\"Head\");\n            if hd then\n                local s,on=camera:WorldToViewportPoint(hd.Position);\n                if on then\n                    local d=(Vector2.new(s.X,s.Y)-ml).Magnitude;\n                    if d<=FOVR and (not a or d<min) then a=b;min=d;end;\n                end\n            end\n        end\n    end\n    return a;\nend\n\ngame:GetService(\"RunService\").RenderStepped:Connect(function()\n    if fov then\n        local ml=UIS:GetMouseLocation();\n        fov.Position=ml;fov.Radius=FOVR;fov.Visible=FOVON;\n    end\n    if snap then\n        local pl=t();\n        if SNAPON and pl and pl.Character and pl.Character:FindFirstChild(\"Head\") then\n            local ml=UIS:GetMouseLocation();\n            local s,on=camera:WorldToViewportPoint(pl.Character.Head.Position);\n            if on then\n                snap.From=ml;\n                snap.To=Vector2.new(s.X,s.Y);snap.Visible=true;\n            else snap.Visible=false;end\n        else snap.Visible=false;end\n    end\nend)\n\nlocal o=m.SpawnBullet;\nm.SpawnBullet=function(...)\n    local g={...};local h=t();\n    if h then\n        local f=(typeof(g[2])==\"Instance\" and g[2].Position)or g[2];\n        local s=h.Character.Head.Position;\n        local v=h.Character:FindFirstChild(\"HumanoidRootPart\") and h.Character.HumanoidRootPart.Velocity or Vector3.zero;\n        local db=g[1];local spd=500;local grav=Vector3.new(0,-workspace.Gravity,0);\n        if db then\n            if db.Speed then spd=db.Speed end;if db.Gravity then grav=db.Gravity end;\n        end\n        local dist=(s-f).Magnitude;\n        local tme=spd>0 and dist/spd or 0;\n        local pred=s+v*tme+0.5*grav*tme*tme;\n        g[3]=CFrame.new(f,pred).LookVector;\n    end\n    return o(table.unpack(g));\nend;\n","features":"- Silent aim\n- Prediction\nThat's all.","tags":[],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"67e899bd1a59c365c57f9964","username":"zins2","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f22744bd974db016bbe913a084e417ba43fed644dc59ebb6709d42f9ab9bfea5.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/67e899bd1a59c365c57f9964-1743297346131.png"},"status":"offline","id":"67e899bd1a59c365c57f9964","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.followers","tier":10},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f22744bd974db016bbe913a084e417ba43fed644dc59ebb6709d42f9ab9bfea5.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/67e899bd1a59c365c57f9964-1743297346131.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-19T22:49:43.204Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"688a699bcc6aebb2f49f983a","editBy":{"_id":"67e899bd1a59c365c57f9964","username":"zins2","status":"offline","id":"67e899bd1a59c365c57f9964"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2025-07-30T18:51:07.195Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"688a6c48cc113cfeaf3e5bb2","commentBy":{"_id":"677be435ea4516cd66668ea7","username":"CatBoy","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4b6fb37706d5f7244291c27fd67e992441678f96672d2dbd77a00b5b52457e79.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/677be435ea4516cd66668ea7-1749212341564.png"},"createdAt":"2025-01-06T14:09:57.872Z","la